{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899980/extras/874c64f097a74b6b45f7f24349d60e67.poster.avif?t=1759999841\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899980/extras/874c64f097a74b6b45f7f24349d60e67.webm?t=1759999841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the chaotic world of <strong>Why Me</strong>, a 2D platformer where every level is designed to surprise and challenge you. Expect tricky obstacles, mind-bending stunts, and levels that constantly keep you on your toes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899980/extras/3b9e743e0eab871251268ee513140442.poster.avif?t=1759999841\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899980/extras/3b9e743e0eab871251268ee513140442.webm?t=1759999841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899980/extras/3b9e743e0eab871251268ee513140442.mp4?t=1759999841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tricky Levels:</strong> Each stage is full of twists, traps, and hidden surprises that test your reflexes and timing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>80 Challenging Levels Across 16 Chapters:</strong> Each chapter introduces new tricks, surprises, and obstacles to keep you on your toes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skill-Based Gameplay:</strong> Precision, quick thinking, and daring maneuvers are key to mastering the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-Paced Action:</strong> Levels are designed to keep the adrenaline high and your reflexes sharp.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Speedrun &amp; Leaderboards:</strong> Race against the clock, master every tricky level, and climb the global leaderboard to see how you stack up against players worldwide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899980/extras/47ba7c239b49a47e1d1d199084b597d4.poster.avif?t=1759999841\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899980/extras/47ba7c239b49a47e1d1d199084b597d4.webm?t=1759999841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899980/extras/47ba7c239b49a47e1d1d199084b597d4.mp4?t=1759999841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you escape the chaos, master the tricks, and beat the game on your own terms?\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899980/extras/c5004100563bb8d05dc02232b34519cd.poster.avif?t=1759999841\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899980/extras/c5004100563bb8d05dc02232b34519cd.webm?t=1759999841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3899980?t=1759999841","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899980/d